*======================================================================
* sc.a99 - a module for tests/test_kernel.py (group scroll): the scrolling
* include and a map the test writes (map.a99) so that the test can call
* SCRINI, SCRTO and SCRBY.
*======================================================================
       COPY "kernel.equ"
       COPY "macros.a99"

       AORG >C000
       DATA INIT,TICK,INIT,0
INIT   RT
TICK   RT

       COPY "scroll.a99"
       COPY "map.a99"
